# Narrow exemptions for the secret scanner (scripts/check-secrets.sh).
#
# One extended regex per line, matched against "path:line:text" for content
# findings and against the path for filename findings. Every entry needs a
# comment saying why it is safe.
#
# Rules of thumb:
#   * Exempt one line, not a rule and not a directory.
#   * If you cannot explain in a sentence why it is safe, it is not.
#   * Never reach for this to unblock a real credential. Rotate it instead.
#
# (Empty. Nothing in this repository has needed an exemption.)
